The rerun has cleared the expensive exact-density stage and is exercising the eight-seed reference panel plus canonical transformations. The four cheap attacks remain separate from the expected-to-succeed Track B reference algorithm, as required.
diff --git a/gen_2603_10944.py b/gen_2603_10944.py
