+def _selected_chain_clauses(n):
+    """Return the concrete n+1 clauses selected by an endpoint-valid path.
+
+    Literal ``v`` is the positive occurrence of variable v and ``-v`` its
+    negation.  Variable 1 is X; variable i+1 is the selected state at internal
+    layer i.  Distinct layer numbers make these state variables distinct even
+    if two modular coordinates happen to agree.
